    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it, so keep it factual. i guess my main worry is when it feels like someone is just being a troublemaker for the sake of it, you know? like they're almost acting malicious or trying to mess things up on purpose. when you're dealing with those kinds of \"bad actors\" who seem to thrive on causing chaos or disrupting the order of a team, what's the best way to handle that through the policy without sounding like i'm just picking on them personally?",
